  "That comparator is the whole point: same engine, same schema, same candidate universe, same budget, with only the learned volume detached. A saving measured that way is a statement about learning rather than about search size. This is separate from the frozen release above, which still performs no learning at all — both statements are true at once, and neither is allowed to imply the other.": "关键全在这个对照上：同一个引擎、同一套模式、同一个候选全集、同样的预算，只把学出来的那一卷拆掉。这样量出来的节省，说的是学习，而不是搜索规模。这跟上面那个冻结的发布是两回事——那个发布仍然完全不做任何学习。两句话同时为真，谁也不许用来暗示另一句。",
  "That the system declares a dataset unlearnable instead of producing a number. This is the control that is allowed to fail, and it failed in the way it was designed to: by refusing rather than by fitting.": "系统会宣布某个数据集学不了，而不是硬给出一个数字。这就是那个被允许失败的对照组——而且它是按设计的方式失败的：靠拒答，不是靠硬凑。",
  "The R5B6A1_3 release performs no policy update at all. The sealed V75–V78 Engine and Atlas line is a separate prototype with its own scoped learning evidence, published below with the benchmark it refused to learn.": "R5B6A1_3 这个发布完全不做任何策略更新。封存的 V75–V78 Engine 与 Atlas 是另一条独立的原型线，有它自己范围明确的学习证据，连同它拒绝去学的那个基准一起发布在下面。",
  "The archive is addressed by a single SHA-256, so the version a reviewer runs is provably the version the numbers came from.": "整个归档由一个 SHA-256 来寻址，所以评审人跑的那个版本，可证明就是这些数字出自的那个版本。",
  "The earlier contour measured a 0% advantage on this same benchmark, and that reading stays in the archive rather than being dropped. A result that changes when the mechanism changes is a fact about the mechanism, not a correction to the record.": "先前那套回路在同一个基准上量到的优势是 0%，而这个读数留在存档里，不被丢掉。一个换了机制就变的结果，说的是机制的事，不是对记录的更正。",
  "The original end-to-end result, on a frozen synthetic task, with a receipt Atlas and a comparator sharing the same engine. It is the anchor the later work was built from.": "最初那个端到端的结果——在一个冻结的合成任务上，带回执 Atlas，对照组用的是同一个引擎。它是后面所有工作的锚点。",
  "The result closest to ordinary language, and the one where the saving cannot be explained away as a shrinking candidate list. The whole official test was run rather than a slice, and 38.2% of words needed more than one check, so the reduction is measuring learning rather than search size.": "最接近日常语言的那个结果，也是最没法用「候选集变小了」来搪塞的那个。跑的是完整的官方测试而不是一个切片，而且有 38.2% 的词需要不止一次检查——所以这个下降量的是学习，不是搜索规模。",
  "The same effect on a second knowledge-graph benchmark, with both campaigns reported rather than the better one.": "在第二个知识图谱基准上的同一效应，而且两次实验都报告，不是只报好的那次。",
  "This is also where the previous release's stated limit fell: the same campaign beats our own strongest alternative method by a paired 27.2%, CI95. Universal superiority over every possible baseline is still not claimed and has not been tested.": "上一版自己划下的那条界线也正是在这里被推翻的：同一次实验以配对的 27.2%（95% 置信区间）胜过我们自己最强的替代方法。至于对任何可能基线的普遍优越性，仍然不作主张，也没有检验过。",
  "V75-V78 sealed public-corpus archive": "V75–V78 公开语料封存归档",
